        "gbp_per_page": 3,
        "brand_story_heading": "An Indian celebration-wear brand for the world",
        "brand_story_text": "<p>Janvi Aika is a premium Indian celebration-wear brand for women who want to feel confident, elegant, and unforgettable during life's most meaningful moments. Our collections include lehengas, graceful Anarkali suits, refined chudidhars, party wear, and one-minute sarees—each piece blending traditional craftsmanship with modern aesthetics.</p><p>We believe fashion is more than clothing—it is confidence, identity, and celebration. Our first store began in Tiruppur, Tamil Nadu; from there we grew a brand that reaches across India and connects with customers globally online.</p><p>Janvi Aika is led by Ms. Pradeepa Senthilkumar, who brings international perspective and a deep love of South Indian heritage. Her vision is a celebration-wear brand that feels both traditional and modern—so Indian outfits shine at parties, milestones, and celebrations everywhere, not only at rituals and weddings.</p><p>From fabric selection to finishing, every piece is carefully quality-checked—because celebration wear is not just worn for a day; it becomes part of your memories.</p>",
        "ig_heading": "Reels & posts",
        "ig_subheading": "Tap a tile to open on Instagram — new drops, reels, and behind the scenes.",
